{"path":"test/cli/agent_cli_queue_model_resync_test.dart","content":"// gh-1617 review r2 (IMPORTANT): a mid-run providers-queue failover must
// re-sync `agent.state.model` exactly like the roles lane's
// `_onRolesNotice` does. The watchdog's arm-time window reads
