  provider: 'anthropic',
  baseUrl: 'https://api.anthropic.com',
  contextWindow: 200000,
  maxTokens: 8192,
);

/// A model on a custom endpoint: the provider flips to `openai` (see
/// `buildCliDefaultModel`) while the key lookup stays by provider kind.
