# Thread 2 — SUGGESTION: `runIdleWindow` evaluated twice per arm

**Fixed as suggested.** `_armRunWatchdog` (`lib/src/agent/agent.dart`) now evaluates the getter once:

```dart
final info = runIdleWindow;
_armedRunIdleInfo = info;
_runWatchdogTimer = Timer(info.window, _onRunWatchdogFired);
```

Behavior is unchanged (the two prior evaluations were synchronous and equal); the arm path — which runs on every agent event via `_touchRunWatchdog` — now pays the `Uri.tryParse` + registry walk once. Pinned green by the watchdog-window suites (`test/agent/run_idle_watchdog_provider_window_test.dart`, `test/providers/run_idle_watchdog_window_test.dart`).

